.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_d9391cabe9f97cac04da0810b0f18733", "thumb": "", "name": "mash036.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_01efea200ef5281d033f03555aa311c6", "thumb": "", "name": "mash037.jpeg"}]}, {"id": 2231, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2022-06-12", "html": "<p>Плавательный водоём в Кировской области в кп Машкачи подготовлен к сезону 2022 г.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_f22265f0346753fbadf3c5c3027a17e8", "thumb": "", "name": "mash038.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_b5a95f3aa1dbe7e82d2f9aec342854dc", "thumb": "", "name": "mash039.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_67ac462523bf615690cc3133216b9830", "thumb": "", "name": "mash040.jpg"}]}]}